{"id":"b89af15c7a7c96cb","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-base-godel-numbering.md","title":"Syntax-Specific Numbering Interface","display":"df-base-godel-numbering — Syntax-Specific Numbering Interface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-base-godel-numbering","aliases":["90-df-base-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-base-godel-numbering — Syntax-Specific Numbering Interface","depends_on":["[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-base-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-base-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-base-godel-numbering — Syntax-Specific Numbering Interface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"15843b2864cea929\" href=\"?note=15843b2864cea929\" title=\"90-df-substitution\">90-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定原扁平签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffSig}(L,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{EffSig}(L,\\eta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=L^\\sharp\">\\(\\Lambda=L^\\sharp\\)</span>。本地补充的特定语法域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^0_\\Lambda\">\\(E^0_\\Lambda\\)</span> 只含带标签的项和公式；不含第 90 本 Expr 另有的公式列分量。</li>\n<li>候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:E^0_\\Lambda\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:E^0_\\Lambda\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E^0_\\Lambda\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E^0_\\Lambda\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_0(t),g_1(\\varphi)\">\\(g_0(t),g_1(\\varphi)\\)</span> 只是在下式给出的类型化应用。词表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_\\Lambda\">\\(\\iota_\\Lambda\\)</span> 是原 ExprWord 的限制，数值表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{\\mathbb N}(n)=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)\">\\(\\iota_{\\mathbb N}(n)=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>编码运算均用函数图表示，不在无效代码处臆造解码值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span> 是本地补足的特定语法接口名，不替代原通用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_E\\)</span>；上标保留来源拼写，不产生外部依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE^0_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_L)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L),\\\\\n\\iota_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ExprWord}_{L,\\eta}\\upharpoonright E^0_\\Lambda,\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N}(n)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle),\\\\\ng_0(t)&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\langle0,t\\rangle),\\qquad g_1(\\varphi)\\coloneqq g(\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle),\\\\\nN_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(g_1(\\varphi),g_1(\\neg\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\},\\\\\nA_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((g_1(\\varphi),g_1(\\psi)),g_1(\\varphi\\land\\psi)):\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\},\\\\\nQ_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((i,g_1(\\varphi)),g_1(\\forall v_i\\varphi)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\},\\\\\nB_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((g_1(\\varphi),g_0(t),i),g_1(\\varphi[t/v_i]_{88})):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\land i\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,v_i,\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}^{88}_\\Lambda(g,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ng:E^0_\\Lambda\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_\\Lambda,\\iota_{\\mathbb N}}(g)\n\\land\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_{\\mathbb N},\\iota_\\Lambda}(d)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\land\n\\forall a\\in E^0_\\Lambda\\ d(g(a))=a\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land N_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\land A_g,Q_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_2\\land B_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_3.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE^0_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_L)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_L),\\\\\n\\iota_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ExprWord}_{L,\\eta}\\upharpoonright E^0_\\Lambda,\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N}(n)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle),\\\\\ng_0(t)&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\langle0,t\\rangle),\\qquad g_1(\\varphi)\\coloneqq g(\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle),\\\\\nN_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(g_1(\\varphi),g_1(\\neg\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\},\\\\\nA_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((g_1(\\varphi),g_1(\\psi)),g_1(\\varphi\\land\\psi)):\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\},\\\\\nQ_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((i,g_1(\\varphi)),g_1(\\forall v_i\\varphi)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\},\\\\\nB_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((g_1(\\varphi),g_0(t),i),g_1(\\varphi[t/v_i]_{88})):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\land i\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,v_i,\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}^{88}_\\Lambda(g,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ng:E^0_\\Lambda\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_\\Lambda,\\iota_{\\mathbb N}}(g)\n\\land\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_{\\mathbb N},\\iota_\\Lambda}(d)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\land\n\\forall a\\in E^0_\\Lambda\\ d(g(a))=a\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land N_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\land A_g,Q_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_2\\land B_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_3.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 原文件仅需要这个特定语法来源与通用有效表示接口的区别，并未调用未提供原文的其它定理。因此这里只补足可计算编号和实际语法操作，不臆加原始递归要求。原 90-df-godel-numbering 的名称、域与条件均保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution","status":