(d)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\land\n\\forall a\\in E^0_\\Lambda\\ d(g(a))=a\\\\\n&\\quad\\land N_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\land A_g,Q_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_2\\land B_g\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_3.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3017,"backlinks":[{"id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"上游 [[90-df-base-godel-numbering]] 给出特定语法环境中的编号约定；这里只比较所列有效性条件，不将两个谓词认作同一接口。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-base-godel-numbering]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["61d70aa13427c3b5","4ce2b2789d377e1f","4de0ebda11529dc6","137d75d038de4a47","15843b2864cea929"]}